<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>비밀 계정 구독 신청</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0f0f10;
            color: #f0f0f2;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 480px;
            background: #18181b;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            border: 1px solid #27272a;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .notice-box {
            background: #202024;
            border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #d4d4d8;
        }

        .notice-box ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .notice-box li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .notice-box li:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .notice-box li::before {
            content: "•";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: #8b5cf6;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #e4e4e7;
        }

        input[type="text"], select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            background-color: #27272a;
            border: 1px solid #3f3f46;
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.2s;
        }

        input[type="text"]:focus, select:focus {
            border-color: #8b5cf6;
        }

        .price-display {
            background: #27272a;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 16px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .price-display span {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #a1a1aa;
        }

        .price-display strong {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: #a78bfa;
        }

        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #6d28d9);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-submit:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1>비밀 계정 구독 신청</h1>

    <div class="notice-box">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff;">입금 및 신청 확인 후 비계 입장 안내해 드립니다.</p>
        <ul>
            <li>계정 닉네임과 인스타그램 아이디를 정확히 기재해 주세요.</li>
            <li>문의사항이 있으시면 언제든 카카오톡 오픈채팅으로 전달 부탁드립니다!</li>
            <li>입금 후 교환 , 환불 어렵습니다 . 이점 확인 후 결제 진행부탁드립니다 결제 진행시 이 점 확인후 결제한것으로 인지하겠습니다</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <form id="subForm">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="nickname">계정 닉네임</label>
            <input type="text" id="nickname" placeholder="닉네임을 입력하세요" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="instaId">인스타그램 아이디</label>
            <input type="text" id="instaId" placeholder="@아이디를 입력하세요" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="period">구독 기간 선택</label>
            <select id="period" onchange="updatePrice()">
                <option value="1개월" data-price="15,000">1개월 (30일)</option>
                <option value="3개월" data-price="45,000">3개월 (90일)</option>
                <option value="6개월" data-price="90,000">6개월 (180일)</option>
            </select>
        </div>

        <div class="price-display">
            <span>결제 예정 금액</span>
            <strong id="priceText">15,000원</strong>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">신청하기</button>
    </form>
</div>

<script>
    function updatePrice() {
        const select = document.getElementById('period');
        const selectedOption = select.options[select.selectedIndex];
        const price = selectedOption.getAttribute('data-price');
        document.getElementById('priceText').innerText = price + '원';
    }

    document.getElementById('subForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        alert('신청이 완료되었습니다.');
    });
</script>

</body>
</html>
